$$
A = \begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\ 0 & {\color{red}1} & 0 & 0 \\ 0 & 0 & {\color{red}1} & 2\end{bmatrix}
$$

- Statement II is true, since all the entries above the main diagonal are zeros:

$$
